OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,FTwo children suffered minor injuries
OL,7,Fin a racist attack on a property in Co
OL,8,FDown.
OL,10,FPolice said they were treating two
OL,11,Fincidents of criminal damage in
OL,12,FHolywood on Sunday as racially
OL,13,Fmotivated.
OL,15,FAt about 11.05pm, the PSNI received a
OL,16,Freport that stones had been thrown
OL,17,Fthrough the front window of a house in
OL,18,Fthe Church Green area of the town.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
