PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785833289
OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "Two children who
OL,7,Fwere inside the living room area at
OL,8,Fthe time, along with other family
OL,9,Fmembers, were struck by the debris and
OL,10,Fleft with grazes to their face and
OL,11,Fshoulder, causing minor injury.
OL,13,F"This appalling incident left a young
OL,14,Ffamily inside terrified and
OL,15,Fdistressed."
OL,17,FA short time later, at about 11.10pm,
OL,18,Fpolice received a second report that a
OL,19,Fproperty had also been damaged in the
OL,20,FChurch Road area.
OL,26,@nD@VOUuD@AOUwD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
