PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785833289
OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,FTwo windows were smashed, and paint
OL,7,Fdamage was caused to the exterior of
OL,8,Fthe house,
OL,10,FTwo windows of a vehicle parked at the
OL,11,Fproperty were also broken and a
OL,12,Fquantity of cash stolen.
OL,14,FThe PSNI spokesperson said:
OL,15,F"Thankfully no-one was injured as a
OL,16,Fresult of this criminal damage,
OL,17,Fhowever this family was also left
OL,18,Funderstandably shocked and upset by
OL,19,Fwhat happened.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785833289
OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,F"We are treating both of these reports
OL,7,Fas racially-motivated hate crimes,
OL,8,Fwith our inquiries continuing into
OL,9,Fwhat happened, and who was involved.
OL,11,F"This type of crime is utterly
OL,12,Funacceptable and has no place in our
OL,13,Fsociety.
OL,15,F"Everyone has the right to feel safe
OL,16,Fin their home, regardless of their
OL,17,Frace or background.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785833289
OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,F"We would urge anyone with information
OL,7,For footage that could help us to do
OL,8,Fthe right thing and come forward with
OL,9,Finformation.
OL,11,F"Call us on 101, quoting reference
OL,12,Fnumbers 1731 and 1740 02/08/26."
OL,14,FNorth Down Alliance Party MLA Andrew
OL,15,FMuir said he was "shocked and
OL,16,Fdisgusted by these hateful and racist
OL,17,Fattacks".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUtD@`O]wD@ROUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
