PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785833289
OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,FHe said: "To see children in
OL,7,Fparticular injured in this way is
OL,8,Frepugnant, and I urge anyone with any
OL,9,Finformation to contact the PSNI
OL,10,Fwithout delay.
OL,12,F"Holywood is a shared and inclusive
OL,13,Fplace, and this kind of violence and
OL,14,Fintimidation does not reflect the
OL,15,Fviews of the vast majority of people
OL,16,Fin the town who are absolutely
OL,17,Fappalled to see this occur."
OL,26,@nD@JOUtD@AOUyD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
