OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785833289
OL,3,CChildren injured in racially motivated
OL,4,Cattack
OL,6,FAlliance councillor Martin McRandal
OL,7,Fsaid: "It is disgusting to see a
OL,8,Ffamily subjected to racially motivated
OL,9,Fcriminal activity in our community and
OL,10,FI want to be clear that those involved
OL,11,Fdo not represent the open and
OL,12,Fwelcoming Holywood that I know and
OL,13,Flove.
OL,15,F"It is important that there are
OL,16,Fconsequences for the perpetrators and
OL,17,FI would urge people to come forward
OL,18,Fand assist the PSNI with their
OL,19,Finvestigations in any way they can."
OL,26,@oD@GOUwD@AOU{D@dO]
